paamal Hasan Ka Laal Hua<br>
<br>
01. Qaimo Me Udasi Chaai Hai<br>
dulhan Pe Qayamat Aai Hai<br>
kuch Der Me Ghar Barbaad Hua<br>
<br>
02. Ghairat Se Jhukaye Sar Dulhan<br>
roti Hai Ke Lut Ta Hai Gulshan<br>
kis Tarah Kare Khismat Ka Gila<br>
<br>
03. Chaya Hua Qaasim Ka Gham Hai<br>
shaadi Ki Jagah Par Maatam Hai<br>
sayedaaniyo Me Hai Hashr Bapa<br>
<br>
04. Maidaan Me Ajab Aafat Aai<br>
tasweer E Ali Khoon Me Doobi<br>
phir Tukde Hua Dil Shabbar Ka<br>
<br>
05. Laashe Pa Ye Rokar Ye Shah Ne Kaha<br>
mai Teri Madad Ko Aa Na Saka<br>
ta Hashr Ye Gham Rulwayega<br>
<br>
06. Sajde Me Jhukaye Maa Ne Sar<br>
qurban Hua Hai Mera Pisar<br>
maqbool Huwi Farwa Ki Dua<br>
<br>
07. Bas Rok Qalam Ko Aye Manzar<br>
sar Peet Ke Rote Hai Sarwar<br>
kehte The Yehi Pamal Hua<br>
